From c35e0fd2596079970efd29f861804ba62ce7e896 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lakr233 <git@qaq.wiki>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 18:02:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 54/68] vgpu: key heap texture residents by resource identity
 and materialize clear-only passes

Give heap-placed textures their own TargetIdentity::Heap namespace carrying task_id, base_ref, serialized TaskResource lifetime generation and declared allocation format instead of colliding across tasks and formats in RGBA8 TargetIdentity::Texture. Retain heap residents through TaskResource leases, exclude them from guest-page reclaim, materialize clear-only heap passes on the GPU, clear chain_from_resident when an unrendered heap LOAD coerces to DontCare, and admit compatible level-0 texture views over heap textures.
